  workaround_implemented_flag boolean

  Note: 'Transactional record of every planned and unplanned interface downtime event affecting interface channels or trading partner connections. Captures downtime start timestamp, downtime end timestamp, downtime type (planned maintenance/unplanned outage/trading partner outage), affected channels, root cause, impact severity, messages queued during downtime, messages replayed after recovery, and incident ticket reference. Supports SLA reporting, root cause analysis, and operational resilience tracking.'
}

